{%- comment -%}
  Product facts from the catalogue clean-up sheet (team-checked, Oct 2026), by product handle.
  Output: pipe-separated keys used by the collection filters (via snippets/plo-card data-f-tags)
  and the product page:
    c-dark / c-milk / c-mixed          chocolate
    f-<flavour family>                 flavour family (classic-chocolate, nutty, caramel-toffee,
                                       coffee-spice, dessert, mixed)
    d-vegan / d-keto                   dietary (only when confirmed Yes)
    keto-no                            confirmed NOT keto: the product page hides the "Suitable for"
                                       tab, whose shared text still promises keto
  Update this list when products change, until these facts live in Shopify metafields.
  Usage: {%- capture facts -%}{%- render 'plo-catalog', handle: product.handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case handle -%}
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-hazelnut-bar-6-x-80g' -%}c-dark|f-nutty|keto-no
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-caramel-crunch-mousse-bar-6-x-80g' -%}c-dark|f-caramel-toffee|keto-no
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-sea-salt-bar-6-x-80g' -%}c-dark|f-classic-chocolate|keto-no
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-bar-6-x-35g' -%}c-dark|f-classic-chocolate|d-keto
